<!-- LEADING IN UNCERTAINTY -->
<div class="offer-block" id="leading-in-uncertainty">
<div class="offer-header">
<span class="offer-tag">Leading in Uncertainty</span>
<h2>Coaching for leaders who don't need another framework. They need to know where to start.</h2>
<p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.05rem;">Built on Powerskills — six capabilities for navigating uncertainty. We don't tour all six. The diagnostic identifies which one or two are actually limiting you right now, and that's where the work begins.</p>
</div>
<div class="pricing-grid">
<div class="pricing-card">
<h4>Standard</h4>
<div class="price">NZD $200</div>
<div class="price-unit">per session, minimum 3</div>
<p>1:1 sessions spaced roughly a month apart, so there's real time between sessions to put the work into practice before we go further. Includes the same $50 diagnostic, credited toward booking.</p>
</div>
<div class="pricing-card featured">
<h4>Full-Impact Package</h4>
<div class="price">NZD $180</div>
<div class="price-unit">per session, 6–8 sessions</div>
<p>Most leaders need 6 to 8 sessions for the work to fully land. Book into this range and the rate drops from $200 to $180/session, plus two complimentary check-ins between sessions.</p>
</div>
<div class="pricing-card">
<h4>Team Coaching</h4>
<div class="price" style="font-size: 1.4rem;">Custom Quote</div>
<div class="price-unit">designed for your team</div>
<p>Custom-designed sessions for a leadership team, priced below the standard 1:1 rate. Get in touch to scope what your team actually needs.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pricing-note">
<strong>What to expect:</strong> sessions are spaced out on purpose. This is leadership capability under real conditions, not a crash course. The gap between sessions is where the practice happens; the diagnostic and the sessions themselves are where it gets named and sharpened.
